SY_TALK("2KqjXnpZymo",[[6,["Sahaj Bhajan - [Ma hum par kripa karna","- From 00:07 to 00:22]"]],[22,["Sahaj Bhajan - [Isliye Mataji humko darshan","hue tumhare - From 00:22 to 00:30]"]],[29,["Jai, jai [Shri Mataji arrives]"]],[41,["Sahaj Bhajan - [Sarva mangal mangalye - Vishwa","Vandita Nirmala Mata - From 00:41 to 09:30]"]],[572,["About 200? Yogi, hurry up, everyone","is standing."]],[578,["I told them to bring them here","somehow or make a way here."]],[582,["There are a lot of people inside.","Can see it from here. Did you tell them?"]],[593,["Look, those people who can't get in,","make room; let these people in."]],[599,["Sahaja Yogi: I request all the brothers","who are standing on the side, there is","plenty of space here, please come."]],[606,["There's room inside, please come and sit.","There's plenty of room on the side."]],[612,["It will be great if everyone sits down."]],[626,["Shri Mataji, all of us (UNCLEAR) from Delhi,","who have gathered here, extends Her","heartfelt greetings to you."]],[669,["Shri Mataji: [Aside - It's hot right now,","I'm sweating, later.]"]],[686,["[MARATHI]"]],[792,["I bow to all the seekers of Truth."]],[804,["I have been told to speak in English","initially and then switch to Hindi."]],[811,["You are, you accept all this, right?"]],[825,["I bow to all the seekers of Truth."]],[831,["At the very outset we have to know","what is the Truth and what are we","seeking."]],[840,["Why this seeking has started in these","recent years?"]],[850,["We have Science, by which we have","overgrown outwardly."]],[859,["We have different devices by which our","life has become more comfortable,","maybe."]],[869,["But Science cannot answer many","questions"]],[873,["and one of the questions it cannot","answer is, 'Why are we here on this","Earth?'"]],[881,["Also Science is amoral."]],[884,["It does not give you any line of action","that will benefit you and that will","nourish you."]],[900,["Of course there is nothing against","Science as such"]],[903,["but it is very incomplete and takes","people into imbalances."]],[911,["There are so many defects which I'm","not going to describe today but"]],[917,["main thing is that it does not give","you the idea of reality,"]],[924,["it does not give you the totality; also, it","does not give you any ascent in your","spiritual life."]],[940,["So much in the West - also in India -","not to that extent but yes, quite a lot,"]],[948,["we have progressed in Science in","every way."]],[955,["But what do we find. There's a decline","in the character of human-beings,"]],[962,["in the society the families are breaking,","children are going astray."]],[969,["Everywhere we find there's such a","decline in the quality of life"]],[975,["and sometimes we cannot also say that","these things are done even by human-","beings."]],[982,["Impossible to explain why people have","fallen to such a low level of existence"]],[991,["and think that that is the best life.","They have lost all the capacity to feel"]],[997,["that we are going very fast towards","our complete destruction."]],[1004,["In the West, I think, the destruction is","working out from within"]],[1009,["and this destruction is not even felt. On","the contrary people think"]],[1016,["they're martyrs, if they are getting","destroyed. So, the seeking has started."]],[1026,["The human beings are now faced with","the problem as to, \"Why are we on this","Earth?\""]],[1032,["\"Are we here just to get into this rut","of this rat race?\""]],[1041,["\"Or as we here just to insure our lives","and ultimately die?\""]],[1046,["\"Is that the aim of our life, is that","the value of our life?\""]],[1052,["In the West, I must say, there have been","very few talks about the inner life,"]],[1062,["about the inner self, and even in India","there has been so much of work done"]],[1071,["but, after the British when they went","away, we suddenly took also -"]],[1077,["specially our intellectuals have become","very Westernized."]],[1080,["They cannot think that India had","anything sensible within, that they","could talk about."]],[1087,["About anybody they write left and right","and try to spread in a way"]],[1096,["that Western ideas of modernism."]],[1102,["This modernism, if it had brought","any kind of good results, one would","have accepted."]],[1109,["Sitting down here in India we don't","know what they are up to,"]],[1113,["in what conditions they are,","how terribly disturbed they are"]],[1118,["what problems they are facing -","we have no idea."]],[1121,["We have only one problem - is","our poverty."]],[1125,["Also, when we start copying them, we'll","have the same problems coming into","India."]],[1134,["So it is important that also the West","must understand that they must"]],[1140,["see that this great tree they have","produced of modern civilization,"]],[1146,["must have its roots somewhere,","and where are those roots?"]],[1150,["And without the nourishment from the","roots, how are they going to prosper,"]],[1154,["how are they going to live, how are they","going to exist, how are they going to","enjoy their life?"]],[1162,["The roots are in this country.","This is a great country of yoga."]],[1170,["Is vibrated with the All-Pervading","Power of Divine Love."]],[1177,["Though we Indians are not yet aware,","that to be born in this country itself","is a great boon."]],[1185,["Neither they are aware as to what, what","has been done by the great saints in","this country"]],[1192,["and how much they have worked hard,"]],[1194,["that one day this country should","spread spirituality all over the world."]],[1202,["Without that you are still not complete."]],[1211,["We are human-beings, we have","reached the state of human awareness"]],[1216,["but we do not know what is Absolute","Truth - we are living very, very relatively."]],[1224,["Some people think this kind of","government is good,"]],[1227,["somebody thinks that kind of","government is good, somebody thinks"]],[1230,["that Economics should be like that,","another thinks like that."]],[1233,["And there's all the times discussions,","arguments and fighting going on."]],[1237,["Ultimately we end up in wars."]],[1242,["This relative life that we have, doesn't","give us any clear-cut idea as to what","is the Absolute."]],[1252,["Unless and until we find that","Absoluteness, we cannot understand","the Truth."]],[1260,["So those who are seeking Truth, have to","strive to know the Absolute."]],[1268,["At this human awareness the problem","is, that we are either involved with our","body, mind,"]],[1276,["also so-called spirituality, emotions -","all these are just appendages, you can","say,"]],[1290,["appendages for your being. We say this","is my body, this is my body, this is my","mind, this is my mind,"]],[1300,["this is my emotions, this is my house,","this is my wife - who is this my?"]],[1305,["Who is the one who owns it? The one","who owns it is the Spirit."]],[1315,["Is the Spirit in your heart, the Spirit","which has not yet come into your","attention."]],[1322,["The light of the Spirit it has not yet","come into your attention, that's why","you think,"]],[1328,["you are this body, you are this mind.","You are not. You are the Pure Spirit."]],[1335,["You are, whether you know it or not.","Also there's another thing one has to","know,"]],[1344,["that there is a All-Pervading Power of","Divine Love, which does all this"]],[1351,["living work of producing these beautiful","flowers, running our heart, looking after","our digestion."]],[1363,["Every sort of a living work is done by","this All-Pervading Power of Divine Love."]],[1373,["In Sanskrit we call it Brahmchaitanya.","Whatever you may call it."]],[1377,["In the Bible it is called as the Cool","Breeze of the Holy Ghost -"]],[1385,["is the power of the Holy Ghost. Also in","Koran it is called as Ruh."]],[1391,["In the religions where they have talked","about the nirakar, about formless,"]],[1399,["they have talked about it. So, this All-","Pervading Power of Paramchaitanya"]],[1406,["exists and we have to get united with","that, that is the real yoga."]],[1415,["Standing on your head and doing","acrobats, is not yoga."]],[1420,["Or reading books and doing mental","acrobats is also not yoga."]],[1427,["What is important is that you have to","grow above your mental capacity."]],[1436,["All the Western world is full of mental","projections"]],[1442,["and these mental projections are linear","in their nature."]],[1447,["They go up to a point, but they are not","substantiated by Truth so they decline","and they fall."]],[1459,["So we have now decline in all our","standards. Then now we cannot have"]],[1466,["people like Mozart, Bach, Strauss","- we cannot have."]],[1474,["We cannot have people like Leonardo","da Vinci or anyone of those great","artist"]],[1488,["because we have lost our capacity","even as a human-being and we are"]],[1497,["trying to do something which has no","even the power of humanity."]],[1505,["Thus this decline is so obvious and","evident in every walk of life,"]],[1511,["everywhere you see, even in India you'll","see that very much so."]],[1516,["We cannot blame anybody for that,","because so far, we have not found the","Absolute Truth."]],[1523,["Unless and until we have found out the","Absolute Truth,"]],[1527,["how can we know what is the right","thing to do. Now whatever I'm telling you,"]],[1534,["you need not believe Me because blind","faith has never helped us."]],[1539,["But whatever I'm telling you, you can","take it as a hypothesis and if it works,"]],[1545,["then you have to accept as Divine","Laws. And if it works in such a way,"]],[1551,["that you obviously see it working, that","you can work it out,"]],[1556,["then of course, you should not deny it."]],[1563,["I think, there are many people who","are talking about it all over the world."]],[1569,["Except in India the intellectuals have","become really, I don't know, deaf and","dumb."]],[1573,["But otherwise, in other countries I've","seen everywhere, you'll find, at least,"]],[1578,["3 to 4 people who are genuinely","interested in knowing the Absolute","Truth."]],[1584,["Especially Russia and the Eastern Bloc","people I was amazed to see"]],[1589,["how they are so much interested to","know what is the Truth is."]],[1594,["They had never known God, they have","never known Divine, they have never known"]],[1598,["anything about it - Kundalini, of course,","is very far away from them."]],[1601,["But the way they took to Sahaja Yoga,","it surprises Me."]],[1606,["In some villages we have about thirty","thousand Sahaja Yogis."]],[1613,["It's very remarkable how these people","didn't take to materialism so much,"]],[1618,["as they have taken in the West and","they know very well now,"]],[1623,["that matter doesn't give you joy, it","doesn't give you happiness,"]],[1626,["it doesn't give you fulfilment. There's","something beyond this matter,"]],[1630,["beyond this mind that we have to","achieve. And that is what is Sahaja","Yoga."]],[1639,["Sahaja Yoga is where 'Saha' means with","and 'ja' is born, with you is born,"]],[1648,["the right, the fundamental right you","have, to achieve this yoga, means, the","union with the Divine."]],[1657,["All the saints of this country have","spoken about it, while even"]],[1662,["many people in England, as you know,","that there have been William Blake,"]],[1666,["now if you read William Blake, English","used to think he was a mad poet -","he's not."]],[1672,["He was the seer and he talked about","it. In every country you'll find somebody"]],[1678,["who has been speaking about this","higher life and these inner value","systems."]],[1690,["For Sahaja Yoga you don't have to","argue, think or put in any effort."]],[1697,["Nowadays I've found that the Buddhism","is very popular in, in the West,"]],[1705,["because it appeals to their brains, it","goes into their brains"]],[1710,["and they can think about it and argue","about it."]],[1713,["Nothing wrong with Buddhism but","as far as Buddha is concerned,"]],[1718,["he was all right. That was the time when","he had to do this tapasya, as you call it,"]],[1726,["the whole penance, but these times are","over. At that time even Christ had to do","also"]],[1733,["and at that time Mahavira also had to","do. Those were the times but today's","times are different."]],[1741,["These are special times, I call them","Blossom Times."]],[1745,["And this is the time where many","flowers have come up."]],[1750,["These are seekers of ancient times -","were seeking the Truth"]],[1755,["and today in this modern times, which","we call as Kaliyuga, they are born"]],[1761,["to get the reward of their seeking. They","maybe Indians, they maybe Germans,"]],[1768,["they maybe English, they maybe","anyone, they have to get this reward"]],[1774,["for their seeking what they have been","doing and the time has come today."]],[1778,["When I say that, people think I'm being","very assertive, but it's a fact."]],[1783,["The truth is, that today is the time for","them to get the reward of their seeking."]],[1791,["They have already told you about the","Kundalini and the inner mechanism."]],[1798,["Even to know about that, is just mental.","Even to listen to My lecture is also","mental."]],[1807,["You have to go beyond your mind, so,","then, something has to happen."]],[1816,["And that happening is nothing but the","awakening of the Kundalini,"]],[1821,["which is really the Pure Desire in your","mind because with other desires you","never feel satisfied."]],[1829,["Unless and until you become the Spirit","you'll never be satisfied,"]],[1833,["you'll never be happy, specially the","ones who are seekers today."]],[1838,["Of course there are many who are","seeking in money, materialism or","maybe in power."]],[1845,["But they are not satisfied people. They","have not achieved anything,"]],[1849,["they don't know the goal of their life;","they are just moving with the winds"]],[1853,["the way wind moves them. So to get","to understand what is the purpose"]],[1860,["of your being a Spirit is that - this is in","a very simple manner I'm saying -"]],[1869,["that you enter into the Kingdom of God.","Is not the kingdom of America or"]],[1877,["kingdom of India or anything like that,","but is the Kingdom of God."]],[1885,["It's all for your well-being and as I said,","as seekers you are all respected, and","you all have to get it."]],[1897,["The problems with us are many but I","can put them in two category -"]],[1902,["is one, is our ego and a another one","conditioning."]],[1907,["These two things bind our life. We live","in the past and the future but"]],[1915,["we cannot stand in the present. But","when this happening takes place,"]],[1921,["then, you're surprised, that the","thoughts that were coming"]],[1926,["from the past and future just stop,","and you are thoughtlessly aware."]],[1931,["This is the first situation, first stage, first","state, where you are thoughtlessly","aware."]],[1940,["This lasts for a short time that's why","Patanjali had called as 'savichar',"]],[1947,["means with thought - awareness with","thought. But in Sahaja yoga, I've seen,"]],[1953,["this can be achieved very easily","through certain time you give to your","meditation"]],[1961,["and only in the present, which is the","reality, you grow and thus you grow"]],[1966,["and grow and reach a state, which we","call as, doubtless awareness,"]],[1975,["which means - also in Sanskrit is called","as 'Nirvikalpa samadhi'."]],[1981,["This is a state which has to be","achieved in Sahaja Yoga."]],[1986,["Now some people want to know,","\"We want to have God's realization.\""]],[1989,["I mean all funny ideas. So many books","are there, then they read them"]],[1993,["and then come, \"Mother, we want God's","realization.\" Means what?"]],[1996,["What does it mean 'God's realization?'","They [UNCLEAR - Challenge?] Me."]],[2004,["But what happens that your Central","Nervous System itself gets enlightened"]],[2010,["by this happening and the light of the","Spirit is felt by your Central Nervous","System."]],[2017,["As in our evolution we have so many","other capacities compared to animals,"]],[2027,["that are all felt on our Central Nervous","System."]],[2031,["In the same way our Central Nervous","System itself gets enlightened,"]],[2036,["which is in Sanskrit language is used as","'Vid' from where the word Ved has","come."]],[2043,["'Vid' is to feel on your Central Nervous","System. Another is 'Bodh'."]],[2049,["Bodh is to feel on your Central Nervous","System. These things you can easily","feel."]],[2057,["On your Central Nervous System your","fingers get enlightened"]],[2062,["and you start feeling on your fingertips","the All-Pervading Power of Divine Love."]],[2074,["You can feel it like cool breeze on your","fingertips. They get enlightened."]],[2081,["For the first time you feel there is a","power around you. Then when you grow"]],[2089,["as I said, you start becoming","collectively conscious, collectively","conscious."]],[2099,["Not that you get Self-knowledge, that","you know about your own centres,"]],[2103,["but you become collectively conscious,","meaning, that you can feel others, their","centres."]],[2112,["Though all our problems in this world","are from human-beings, most of them."]],[2120,["They all come from these centres. And","if these centres, are being somehow,"]],[2127,["are cured, then we are alright and if we","can help others to cure their centres,"]],[2135,["what will happen - a new race of","enlightened people will be established."]],[2144,["This is the time of Last Judgment. This","is the time of Last Judgment where","people"]],[2151,["have to judge themselves. If they want","to go to Hell, it's quite easy"]],[2155,["and if they want to go to Heaven, that's","also quite easy but the choice is yours."]],[2161,["Nobody can force a human-being to","choose."]],[2165,["That's his freedom, that's her freedom,","because freedom has been granted"]],[2173,["and cannot be taken away. So now, for","you it is important to decide today,"]],[2182,["tonight, whether you want to have your","Self-realization or not."]],[2189,["I cannot force on you, I cannot.","I respect your freedom."]],[2194,["I cannot force it, so you have to","decide. But remember,"]],[2199,["that you are a human-being and you","are at the epitome of evolution."]],[2204,["You are the glorious ones. Your glory","you don't know."]],[2208,["You don't know how many","powers you have."]],[2211,["Unless and until you get your","realization, you will not know."]],[2215,["For example, this instrument, if it is not","connected to the mains,"]],[2219,["it has no identity, it has no meaning, it","has no use. In the same way,"]],[2223,["your situation is, and once you get this","realization, then absolutely,"]],[2231,["it's a different world into which you will","be. I'm telling you we have here,"]],[2236,["I don't know, they say there are people","from sixty nations, but whatever it is"]],[2240,["if you see them, you'll be very happy -","everybody describes them as angels."]],[2247,["They don't fight, they don't quarrel,","there's no argument, nothing."]],[2253,["They enjoy each other, they love each","other. Apart from that, of course,"]],[2259,["they are enjoying each other by also,","they pull each other's legs,"]],[2264,["that I know and sometimes make fun,","but that's how they live."]],[2268,["There is no malice, there's no hatred,","there's no jealousy, nothing."]],[2273,["Nobody is bothered about these","useless things."]],[2276,["So, this is what has to happen and for","that, this is the country where you have"]],[2284,["already, so many blessings of Divinity,","that you can easily get it on this soil"]],[2297,["which is so auspicious."]],[2301,["I wanted to tell you all this, that","you are searching for the Truth and","yet you are not searching for it."]],[2312,["Many people, just like that, go to the temple","since they have to, go to the mosque since","they have to, go to the gurudwara since","they have to."]],[2320,["They don't know why they have to go.","Well, Mother, it's the society, it's","the community, so have to go."]],[2326,["But what you're getting there is to","be seen. Something has been lost."]],[2335,["What was lost, as we put it in","Guru Nanak's words, is that,"]],[2342,["\"Why should you go for searching in the","forest? The ever-resident, the","ever-detached, is within you.\""]],[2349,["Now we'll do all sorts of things.","Then secondly – I've also been to","the Gurudwara many times."]],[2357,["And used to see that uninterrupted","recitation was going on, people","were memorizing everything."]],[2363,["Oh, what a great thing He has done","for us! Such a big 'Granth Sahab',","meaning a great treatise."]],[2369,["Only lines of it are being recited.","That's why Kabir Das ji said, \"The","Pandits have become fools after","studying so much.\""]],[2376,["What is written inside it? Nanak says,","\"Without recognizing your own Self, the","moss of confusion cannot be dispelled.\""]],[2385,["Similar is the condition of Hindus,","where it is said, in the Vedas,","in the Puranas, everywhere,"]],[2394,["even Krishna said, 'There is only one","Spirit in everyone,' so how are you","creating castes?"]],[2400,["Why were castes created? You are seeing","its consequences. Still castes exist."]],[2408,["And casteism has become so strong","that it is hard to understand."]],[2413,["Just think who was the one who wrote","The Ramayana. Valmiki, a dacoit,","and that too a fisherman."]],[2423,["After finding him, Ramachandraji","said, \"You write my Ramayana.\"","Couldn't he find anyone else?"]],[2430,["Couldn't find any such pure man?","Caught hold of a dacoit."]],[2437,["And who wrote the Gita? Who was","the one who wrote the Gita?"]],[2445,["A illegitimate child of a maid. He wrote It.","Tell Me what does this indicate?"]],[2457,["He ate the pre-tasted berries of Shabri.","Why did He do all this?"]],[2463,["Why did He need to do all this,","all this drama? To show,"]],[2470,["that the person who has attained the","essence of saintliness, who has known","Brahma, is the real Brahmin."]],[2482,["Today who is the one who knows Brahma?","I don't see anyone."]],[2491,["So where did these castes come from?","Some were made Shudras, some were","made this, some were made that."]],[2498,["This caste by birth was formed later.","So this irony of Hindu religion is","difficult to see."]],[2509,["And we're still going with everything","that way."]],[2512,["And we think this is the greatest act","of religion. There is no dearth of","fake gurus."]],[2520,["And in every street of your Delhi you'll","find many such gurus and tantriks sitting."]],[2525,["Many are also surrendered at their feet.","So much has been written about this"]],[2533,["that who is the real Guru? Nanak Sahib","has written an entire chapter on this."]],[2540,["Who is the real guru? The one who","takes money from you – tell Me?","Does God understand what money is?"]],[2550,["Oh, this is a headache humans have created","for themselves. Does He understand banks,","does He understand money? Does He?"]],[2560,["They are selling Him, selling religion.","They are spreading false rumors."]],[2566,["\"We'll do this and show, we'll do that","and show,\" and, \"Your father's","treasure is buried there.\""]],[2572,["And, 'You have such an enmity with","so-and-so,' - all these things to","incite mutual conflict."]],[2577,["We should also look at their own lives,","how is their own life?"]],[2581,["What is the life of such a man like?","Is there any purity in his life?"]],[2587,["Is there any love, any understanding,","any elevation, any affection? - nothing."]],[2593,["And they are sitting around posing","as big saints. They collect crores","of rupees."]],[2598,["This is the wisdom of our Indians these","days. Going wherever everybody is going."]],[2608,["There were old tales, one of them","was that someone's father said,"]],[2615,["\"Look, son, you go where everyone","else goes.\" Said, \"Okay.\""]],[2621,["So, standing at the crossroads, he","wondered should follow where","everyone was going."]],[2627,["They were all heading towards the","crematorium; foolishly he followed them."]],[2633,["Very few people have the intelligence","that an Indian has."]],[2639,["Very sorted out, sensible, and intelligent.","Despite having everything,"]],[2648,["in foolishness nobody can - do such","stupid things that cannot understand."]],[2654,["But the real guru-ghantaals here","— one or two still remain —"]],[2660,["they all went abroad. This is a","good thing, because they are","involved in money."]],[2664,["We were saved because we are not","that rich."]],[2668,["This was only God's Grace, otherwise,","as I see people there, they are","rolling on the road."]],[2675,["This is their condition because","they have destroyed their intelligence","so much. Now there is a gentleman"]],[2681,["he explains that this is how you","conquer and control the minds","of others."]],[2687,["And he swings a pendulum in his hand."]],[2690,["They'll have a man stand up and say,","'Look, I can swing this pendulum.'"]],[2694,["Now everybody over there in America,","gape at it. The poor people have never","seen all this kind of stuff."]],[2701,["Are we born to swing the pendulum?","Is there no other business left?"]],[2707,["The other gentleman says that you","will be able to rise at three feet.","Just tell?"]],[2713,["Oh, the top officials here are his","disciples. What's supposed to be done","with rising at three feet?"]],[2718,["Just now there was so much traffic on","the road, what would have happened had","these three feet gone there?"]],[2723,["As it is there's a jam on the road.","What is this stupid talk? People","believe it and pay many thousand rupees."]],[2731,["There are different tricks in our","country and different tricks there."]],[2734,["They have understood that the poor","people there don't know anything.","Whatever you say is right."]],[2739,["Whatever you tell is fine.","But you people know."]],[2744,["You know that this is filth, this","is sin, this is immorality. Poor","fellows, they don't know."]],[2756,["So they have risen so high, and we","still don't think, 'We have to","achieve something.'"]],[2766,["\"After all, we came into this world.\"","Are we here just to waste our lives","like this?\""]],[2774,["Now, all this knowledge of Sahaja","that I am sharing, you will see","is this My knowledge?"]],[2783,["This has been going on in this","country since times immemorial."]],[2787,["Kabirdasji has said, \"Ida, Pingala,","Anhad Nadi, Sukhman Nadi,\""]],[2797,["\"Ida, Pingala, Sukhman Nadi,\"","it is clearly stated."]],[2801,["\"Shoonya shikhar par anahad baaji re,\"","(The unstruck melody resounds at the peak","of the head) but no one understands him?"]],[2808,["I am surprised that in Bihar, where","he did so much work, people call","tobacco, Surati."]],[2816,["He had called Kundalini as Surati, \"Surati","chadhe kamaan.\" (Kundalini ascends the bow)","Oh my, where has this reached?"]],[2824,["Some people are very clever at","spoiling everything."]],[2830,["And we are fools and agree with them."]],[2833,["How great this country is, how great","its greatness is, all this will be","understood when you come into Sahaja."]],[2841,["When our foreign Sahaja Yogis come here,","then first after alighting from the","airplane"]],[2849,["bow down and kiss this land because","they know what vibrations are."]],[2857,["They recognize vibrations and know that","these vibrations are flowing from our earth."]],[2865,["And you people too must have done","no less good deeds that you're","born on this earth."]],[2872,["This is also a great act of virtue.","It is because of this virtue that","you have come here today."]],[2879,["Now many people also ask this question,","\"So, Mother, what will happen of\"","our poverty?\""]],[2884,["That's right. We should first think","from where does poverty come."]],[2890,["Selfishness, comes from selfishness.","But when a person becomes selfless","and comes into the collective,"]],[2903,["then, this kind of collective form","can completely eliminate poverty."]],[2913,["Now what can I tell you that diseases","are cured in Sahaja Yoga, you don't","have to pay a single penny."]],[2918,["All kinds of diseases, including","cancer, have been cured."]],[2921,["Now, just yesterday, you might have","noticed that there was a woman there","who was blind; she came and told Me,"]],[2927,["\"Mother, I have come from so far","to see You, and I cannot even see.\""]],[2932,["So I just held a candle in front of her,","and then after a while she says,","\"I have begun to see everything.\""]],[2938,["I didn't do anything, I didn't do.","Her Kundalini awakened."]],[2942,["And It shone a light into the optic","lobe here, and she began to see."]],[2947,["There was a girl who was dumb, couldn't","speak. They brought her to Me."]],[2954,["Simply whispered Krishna's mantra into","her ear, and from that moment onwards,","she began to speak."]],[2962,["She called Me \"Mother\" at that moment","and then she started talking."]],[2965,["Now this is not a miracle for Me,","no miracle at all."]],[2970,["Is this a miracle for you?","This is not a miracle."]],[2975,["See, this Kundalini, when It awakens,","It passes through the six chakras."]],[2981,["And as it passes through these six","chakras, it illuminates your chakras","completely."]],[2988,["And It fills it with Its energy."]],[2994,["It is because of the disturbance in","these chakras that you remain","sick and you suffer."]],[3000,["And once this Kundalini rises, what","is there to say? Then everything","falls into place."]],[3006,["All cases are set right, and thousands","of people are cured in this way."]],[3011,["And if someone comes after doing","something mischievous, it doesn't","work out - don't know why."]],[3017,["Kundalini knows this very well. She is","your Mother. Everyone's individual Mother."]],[3024,["And just like a tape recording,","She knows everything about you."]],[3028,["And if there's humility within you,","then Kundalini rises and does all","the work properly."]],[3037,["It is true that many people get","cured through Sahaja Yoga."]],[3041,["This is not a false thing. But don't","come to Sahaja Yoga to get cured."]],[3045,["Come to get realized, that's good.","Once you are realized, your illnesses","will be cured."]],[3053,["Many types of diseases were cured.","Those who did not have children,","they had children."]],[3057,["There are many diseases for which there","is no cure,"]],[3061,["many such diseases are cured by Sahaja Yoga."]],[3065,["Now look at the farmers here. Many people","have been told that with Sahaja Yoga"]],[3071,["if you cultivate your crops with vibrated","water, you come to Sahaja Yoga"]],[3077,["so that your farming can increase tenfold.","But no one listens."]],[3082,["People from various agricultural schools","did so much research on it and reported"]],[3089,["'Look, there's been such a research.'","Even a very famous Austrian"]],[3096,["Mr. Hameed, Dr. Hameed, came here,","and he was the first advisor to the UNO."]],[3104,["He also conducted an experiment and","explained it to everyone.","But I don't know what the matter is."]],[3109,["It doesn't go into anyone's head. It's","as if someone's head is upside down."]],[3114,["Well, do farming with this. Farming in this","way, if you see ten fields,"]],[3121,["and if there is a lush green field among","them, then know that it belongs to some","Sahaja Yogi."]],[3127,["In everything. In animal husbandry.","I've seen that they conducted experiments","and told that"]],[3134,["a cow gives about ten kilograms of milk.","It's quite surprising—our Indian cow."]],[3144,["And the seeds they use are not just the","kind you buy from a store or something."]],[3153,["But a very ordinary seed. So much","can grow from that seed. But no","one is willing to listen."]],[3160,["Now, if you call a newspaper person","in India, then their sight is on"]],[3166,["that there was a carpet laid at your","place, that there was a lamp lit at","your place;"]],[3171,["Is there something beyond that or not?","Don't see anything at all. No one listens"]],[3175,["neither writes anything. Will just write","some stupid things. There's no meaning","in them."]],[3181,["I have brought such a big thing before you."]],[3183,["Well, listen to something; No, not","ready to listen."]],[3187,["Don't know what kind of brain these","people have here."]],[3189,["On the contrary, if you look in Russia,","that the very old St. Petersburg,"]],[3195,["the oldest, they say, is the Academy","of Science and Arts, they gave Me","such a grand title"]],[3203,["that I was surprised; I said, 'Sir,","I haven't even graduated,"]],[3207,["didn't do anything like science or arts.","So he said,"]],[3211,["\"Whatever discoverers there are, the","ones who make discoveries, they never","even go to the university.\""]],[3216,["\"And here we've only given it to ten","people, and You're one of them,","one is given to Einstein.\""]],[3220,["So I said, \"Gave it to Einstein,","gave it to Me too.\""]],[3223,["\"Yes, You have made a greater discovery","than Einstein.\""]],[3227,["And out of shame, I, couldn't understand","that I had done anything like that."]],[3233,["This is our old thing. This is our country's","heritage. This only is our heritage."]],[3239,["From where to where, so many years ago,","thirteen thousand years ago, Markandeya","wrote in Sanskrit."]],[3246,["It is certain that earlier, a guru would","take only one disciple. For example, King","Janaka took only one disciple, Nachiketa."]],[3256,["And this only is the tradition. But","in the twelfth century, Gnyaneshwarji","told his guru, his brother,"]],[3266,["\"No, please give Me only this permission","to write about it, please give Me","this much permission.\""]],[3271,["And when He wrote the sixth, the sixth","chapter of His Gyaneshwari, in it Kundalini"]],[3279,["is beautifully described, and it is","due to this Kundalini that you","attain enlightenment,"]],[3285,["receive it, this is also clearly written."]],[3288,["So the Spiritual leaders of that time","who were there said, \"This is all","nonsense, this is prohibited.\""]],[3293,["\"No one should read it, leave it,\"","and cut it. Such people are still","there nowadays."]],[3298,["Some are religious gurus, and others","are all sorts of people who consider","themselves very intelligent."]],[3307,["And because it's cut off completely,","all those people also leave it."]],[3312,["But still, a Guru had only one disciple.","The Nathpanthis have done this work."]],[3317,["Three types of work have been done","here. One was the work of the Vedas,","and from that, Vedanta."]],[3324,["And another act done was that of","devotion, but the real work was","done by the Nathpanthis"]],[3332,["who have done a lot of work on","the awakening of Kundalini etc."]],[3339,["Nanak Saheb also knew it, He knew","it very well."]],[3344,["Namdev was a tailor. In India, the","status of a tailor is not considered","to be of great erudition."]],[3354,["An ordinary tailor and his maid,","Jana Bai, were also very influential."]],[3362,["He went to meet a potter, whose","name was Gora Kumbhar."]],[3366,["That potter was breaking up the","clay with his feet. Seeing him,","Namdev suddenly -"]],[3378,["wonderful people, were wonderful","people. And what did he say,","said in Marathi,"]],[3385,["'Nirguna cha bheti alo sagunachi'.","I came to meet the Formless, but you","are standing in form."]],[3393,["Who could say such a thing? Who","could say such a great thing","for another person?"]],[3398,["If an Indian meets another and","does not abuse, then only you can","consider yourself happy."]],[3403,["But what does one saint say when","he sees another saint?"]],[3410,["What is he saying? That You are the","Formless standing in Form."]],[3417,["Then he went to Punjab. In Punjab","Nanak Sahib recognized him. He","was a very prominent figure."]],[3424,["He told him that, \"Okay, you learn","Punjabi and write in Punjabi.\""]],[3430,["And he has written such a big book","in Punjabi, and many of his works","are also included in the Granth Sahib."]],[3435,["Now this recognition, this understanding,","can only come to saints."]],[3443,["This sight and this subtle vision","can only come to saints."]],[3450,["So much change happens in a person after","Sahaj. But I won't say many things because","half the people will get up and leave."]],[3458,["Meaning this that one gives up alcohol","completely. Everyone said not to drink."]],[3465,["In Muhammad Sahab's time he said,","\"Don't drink alcohol,\" but cigarettes","didn't exist then."]],[3473,["So Nanak Sahib came in His place","and said, \"Well, don't even smoke","cigarettes.\""]],[3478,["But all this is simply been said,","otherwise you go to London and","you'll be shown"]],[3486,["that what a huge pub they have. They","have opened a pub inside their house.","Even the British don't do that."]],[3491,["They also keep somewhere in the","cupboards, but this is right in front.","There's a pub, a pub."]],[3500,["This thing that has come that what","they have said, what they have told,"]],[3505,["it has become very difficult for","people to comply."]],[3511,["Some do it, some do it secretly,","some do it halfway, some do it a lot."]],[3516,["Because they don't have that strength,","they aren't capable. But in Sahaja Yoga,","you become capable."]],[3522,["Understand it like this, if I had","a snake in My hand and I am a","very stubborn woman"]],[3527,["and if you say, \"You're too","stubborn,\" then I'll never agree."]],[3533,["And then, with all the flattery","you say that, \"Sir, this snake is","in Your hand, You drop it.\""]],[3539,["I'll say, \"No, it's a rope.\" Am","sitting in the dark so it's a rope.","Start insisting on it."]],[3545,["\"This is a rope, this is a rope.\" In the","end, when the snake bites, only then","will I come to know that it's a snake."]],[3551,["But when a little light comes in, I","let it go. The thing drops in an instant."]],[3558,["In this way, the things that have","become ingrained in us, which are","destroying us, are completely removed."]],[3565,["Man becomes absolutely clean. Yes, there's","one more thing I need to tell you."]],[3571,["That our famous shehnai player—you know,"]],[3578,["Bismillah Khan Sahib, he once","came to our program."]],[3584,["So he looked at all the Sahaja Yogis","sitting there and said, \"Mother,","You have purified them.\""]],[3592,["\"These have become so pure.\" \"Yes,\"","I said, \"Look, they're so pure.\""]],[3597,["So I said, \"What Khalistan are they creating?\"","he asks Me."]],[3600,["I said, \"You go and ask them,","what are you asking Me.\""]],[3603,["Whose Khalistan are you creating?","Khalis means pure, clean."]],[3607,["When you have become pure, this is","what He said, \"You become pure.\""]],[3611,["And a lot of hard work was done on the","Sikhs. Same is the case with Muslims."]],[3616,["Muslims were told that a great revolution","called Qiyama had been arranged."]],[3626,["'When the resurrection comes, your hands","will speak and bear witness against you.'","It has been clearly stated."]],[3634,["Where did it go? Jesus has said some","wonderful things: \"Thou shalt not","have adulterous eyes.\""]],[3643,["Just tell, what a great thing it is!","And show Me which of these people","have clean eyes,"]],[3649,["and pure and immaculate? Won't find","any. Reason is - it's not a thing","to be blamed -"]],[3657,["The reason is that,","that within","there is no strength. When that","power comes within"]],[3661,["then man fearlessly sings","'Nirbhay Nirgun'."]],[3668,["You look around this country, so many","people have done such important work."]],[3676,["We should not go along with the","attitude these foreigners have","these days"]],[3689,["and neither should we run along","with the enormous progress they","have already made."]],[3696,["Because go and see what their","condition is. In fact, we need to","protect our spiritual,"]],[3706,["we should see progress in what we","call spirituality. We are very","deserving of it."]],[3714,["And the whole world will fall at","your feet tomorrow, if you achieve","your spiritual progress."]],[3720,["But we do not know how big a","source this is within us."]],[3726,["Now let Me tell you, all of you who have","come, I know you all will get realization","today. There is no doubt about it."]],[3731,["But if even one-eighth of that number","were in a foreign land, My limbs","would get tired."]],[3738,["But once they connect, once they are","realized, they stand in such a way","that I don't understand."]],[3746,["And Indians are such that, \"Come on","let's listen to Mataji's speech today,","and tomorrow we'll go there and listen.\""]],[3752,["\"Then we'll listen to a third person's","speech, then we'll go somewhere to","perform aarti,\" there's no depth at all."]],[3758,["And in a country that had and has","such depth, such people have been","in this country"]],[3765,["In that country, for some unknown","reason, man has lost his depth."]],[3774,["We must understand that all our","questions will be resolved at once."]],[3781,["And it's also true that whatever dilemmas,","whatever problems are there –"]],[3785,["A gentleman came and was telling Me that,","\"Mother, I had so many problems, they","all ran away by themselves.\""]],[3791,["\"Troubles were in trouble. Now I","have no troubles at all.\""]],[3799,["So I said, \"How did this happen?\"","\"This is what I don't understand,","I've come to ask You.\""]],[3802,["I said, \"Well, don't ask Me.\" I want","to take you all into this world of bliss."]],[3809,["I want to take you to a world of such","love where this love is selfless,"]],[3813,["in which there is no depravity of","any kind what is a thing."]],[3819,["In this Nirvajya means that he","has accepted the power of love."]],[3825,["This means that there is only the","enjoyment of loving."]],[3830,["Just look, they said to Me, \"Mother,","tell us, what are the things Indians","like, we'll bring those?\""]],[3838,["I said, \"Bring a little only,\" they've","brought it and put it on My head,","and now are saying, \"You distribute","it to everyone.\""]],[3842,["Now I said, \"How can I distribute?","You've brought so much stuff,","who knows what all.\""]],[3847,["And have brought them after so much","thought. Said, \"Can't find good","needles here,\" so have brought them."]],[3854,["\"Can't find good scissors here,\"","so have brought them."]],[3858,["Tell Me, with so much thought and love,","and indeed with the kind of, they're","about to have a tour,"]],[3867,["400-500 people, where they live—","they live in such nice houses, they","have cars, they have everything"]],[3874,["- are living very happily. Ask how are","they, \"Wow! In great joy. There is","so much joy in India.\""]],[3879,["\"Well, what's the matter?\" They want","the bliss of the Spirit, not the body."]],[3884,["And Indians are they'll say, \"We","want an attached bathroom.\" These","don't say that."]],[3889,["Indians are even more amazing. We","built their ashram in Ganpatipule."]],[3895,["So Indians said that, \"We want","Western bathrooms.\""]],[3899,["And they said that, \"We want Indian","style because they are very clean.\""]],[3902,["Now tell, how did this happen?","How did these people change?","How did their views change?"]],[3909,["How did they start understanding","all this? They're all so sweet."]],[3913,["And the Sahaja Yogis here too are","very lovely. They are very nice."]],[3917,["Tell Me, an Indian man becomes","completely honest. Have you heard","of it anywhere? Absolutely 100%."]],[3927,["And they all think it's My money,","\"No, no, it's Mother's money,","put it in there.\""]],[3935,["We're no less when it comes to stealing","our mother's money. But no, are so honest.","Then, don't tell lies."]],[3943,["There was a gentleman who said that,","\"Mother, I used to think I was a lion","because I used to carry a gun.\""]],[3950,["\"Now I'm truly a lion. I don't","want a gun, I don't want anything.\""]],[3955,["Such people have changed, become so","lovely, because you are truly so lovely."]],[3962,["Full of love, but had forgotten.","Ultimately, because of lack of","self-knowledge."]],[3970,["Now gain your knowledge. For your own","knowledge, the knowledge of the Self,","which we call"]],[3976,["Inner Knowledge, and you can know","everything you want about it."]],[3981,["And you can't pay for this,","understand that first of all."]],[3985,["Indians don't even understand this.","One day they brought and gave Me","a 25 paise coin."]],[3990,["I said, \"I don't take money.\"","\"Okay, take one rupee.\""]],[3995,["They cannot understand that Someone","does something like this for free."]],[4002,["But how much will you pay for it?","It has no value. It has no value."]],[4008,["You can't pay for this, and it's not like","if I give a lecture today, it's free,","and then after that money - no money"]],[4017,["at all. You must understand that this","is a game of vibrations, and you cannot","pay money for this game of vibrations."]],[4027,["And the person who asks you for money","in the name of God, think that, there","can be no greater thief than him."]],[4033,["He doesn't even fear God. Yes, it's","alright, now they've decorated the","pavilion so beautifully"]],[4040,["you got the expenses for that, that","you can fix up, but you can't pay","for Self-realization."]],[4047,["What is this thing money? But many","receive the blessings of Goddess Lakshmi."]],[4056,["Many have said, \"Mother, as soon as","we came to Sahaj, we were blessed","by Goddess Lakshmi.\""]],[4060,["But this too is an illusion. We","have to go beyond that."]],[4065,["And going forward, you have to","enjoy the joy of the light of","your Spirit."]],[4071,["In that bliss, all knowledge stands","before you."]],[4075,["Because you have everything within","you, you just need to awaken it."]],[4081,["There is no favor of Mine in that,","no deal is there."]],[4086,["It's your right which I am giving you;","it is your right only and you must","receive it."]],[4093,["There's no need to be grateful for","this. But do understand yourself"]],[4101,["that we have found this thing, such a","priceless thing, my Sadguru. I am not","even a guru, I am only a Mother."]],[4111,["And I didn't even give it to you;","You have received your own thing."]],[4115,["But don't throw away something so","valuable on the street. Don't","diminish its importance either."]],[4125,["It's a very important thing. It will","solve every kind of problem."]],[4129,["This is a Mother saying. One should offer","temptation, right? Tell something or the","other, people get trapped by temptation."]],[4135,["But the fact is son, you won't","find peace until you get it."]],[4139,["I tell this to everyone, no one is","at peace without it."]],[4143,["And the future of this country is that","there are going to be many, many Sahaja","Yogis here. And then see."]],[4149,["People ask that, \"Mother, what is the","future of our country?\" I say,","\"It is very bright.\""]],[4154,["The point is that after attaining","Self-Realization here today, you","should work hard on it."]],[4162,["Sometimes the connection gets loose,","fix it. There are centers here for that."]],[4168,["And the second thing you should understand","is that this is a collective system."]],[4172,["This is a collective arrangement.","It is not something that"]],[4176,["you are now sitting in your home","and doing Sahaja Yoga."]],[4179,["Have to do that too, but you have to","get along with everyone. Just like a","nail doesn't grow back if it's cut."]],[4192,["If you become a part of this unified","collective, vibrated Collective Consciousness"]],[4203,["then, no question arises, and you'll be","surprised at the way people will help you."]],[4213,["If someone here gets some sickness,","they come rushing from Germany."]],[4217,["Inform anyone, \"Look, this is the thing.\""]],[4220,["\"Yes, he's staying over there, inform","him. Mother, he knows, he'll come.\""]],[4225,["The whole world is with you. You","have real kinship in the whole world."]],[4235,["I will only say that Gnyaneshwar Ji has","said that, \"Such a day is about to come.\""]],[4241,["\"When such people will come and such and","such work will be done,\" and there is a","very beautiful description in the","Guru Granth Sahib as well."]],[4250,["It's described everywhere. Just","understand it and believe it"]],[4256,["that this time has come and you are one","of those who can benefit from it."]],[4262,["May God bless you all!"]],[4281,["Just shift aside, the poor fellow is","not sitting comfortably. You please","make him sit comfortably."]],[4295,["[A woman cries and mutters something incoherent]"]],[4303,["What's it? Of epilepsy?"]],[4304,["Woman: Yes, epilepsy [UNCLEAR]"]],[4306,["Shri Mataji: Now see, she should understand","that she's brought her daughter and made","her sit in front of everyone."]],[4312,["Now here people have come for","Self-realization."]],[4315,["If people here go to our temple,","everyone's illnesses can be cured."]],[4321,["But she thought, out of her selfishness,","that she should make the child sit in front,","so that everyone would be disturbed."]],[4326,["Huh? That's wrong. People come","here for self-realization."]],[4330,["She can be cured, it would hardly","take any time."]],[4333,["You know, a doctor here has an","M.D. in epilepsy."]],[4340,["But no one will come at all –","only in front of Mother."]],[4342,["Only Mother should cure this, Mother","only should do this work. All such","people will come forward."]],[4348,["Wherever whatever work needs to be","done, must be done. Today it is","about Self-realization."]],[4353,["Did you understand? Do you understand,","child? Now come, I'll cure you. Okay?","Yes, you're a good girl."]],[4359,["It'll be done. Let it be now.","Not now, not now. So many people","are sitting just now—okay?"]],[4367,["Our one doctor has done experiments","on this and has received an M.D."]],[4373,["You shouldn't have sat in front of Me","with your such daughter like that."]],[4375,["Now My powers are flowing, and","children are harmed by it."]],[4379,["I think it's better if you take her out.","Will see later. Don't cry, I'll cure her."]],[4384,["There is nothing to cry about. But","you people won't come to the temple."]],[4389,["You won't come there and get your","treatment done. There's something","strange about everything."]],[4397,["Now if you have to wait there for","a while, you get disturbed."]],[4401,["Well, after all, if you go to the","hospital, you have to wait there as","well, isn't it?"]],[4405,["She'll have another attack; you'd better","take her outside, because My Power","is very active at this time - yes."]],[4412,["No, no, let her go back, I think."]],[4415,["Let her go outside a little bit otherwise","she might get another attack. Slowly,","slowly."]],[4424,["She'll be fine in a moment. We","shouldn't disturb everyone now."]],[4430,["Yes! Just as she's your daughter, she's","My daughter too; Don't worry. Just pick","her up and take her away."]],[4438,["For all of you I want to say that","whoever is suffering from any problem,"]],[4441,["you please write a letter and","give it to Me now."]],[4443,["\"We have this problem or this trouble,\"","and then you come to the temple."]],[4448,["We have centers all over the place","here, and everyone can cure you."]],[4453,["There's nothing like that. So you","all get well. And people do get well."]],[4458,["But you won't come then how will","it be done? I'm doing something else","here right now, okay?"]],[4464,["Yes, it's okay, sit down. I'm feeling","unwell too, what to do?"]],[4480,["But all these problems can be","solved. I tell you, they all can","be solved."]],[4486,["You should work a little hard.","Okay, no problem."]],[4499,["This disease also can go away","very easily, very easily."]],[4507,["And if her mother practices Sahaja Yoga,","she only can cure her."]],[4512,["Those who are relations if they","practice Sahaja Yoga, then it will","be of great benefit."]],[4521,["Come on, now again I say: all those","who want to attain Self-realization","they all should come here."]],[4531,["And those who don't want to take it,","please go away, then it's a good thing."]],[4537,["And it's just a matter of ten minutes;","For Indians, it takes no time at all."]],[4543,["But if everyone could please sit","down, it would be a great favor."]],[4546,["Because I told you that the Earth","that is, the greatest country on it","is My India."]],[4556,["And you're sitting in this, just","tell - you believe it."]],[4584,["Now everyone has to raise their hands","towards Me like this, lifting them."]],[4592,["Not too much, simply just keep your","hands, as much as you can tolerate."]],[4598,["Not too much like this, keep","your hands like this."]],[4602,["Now, I told you that these fingers","which are, five, six, and seven,","are your seven chakras."]],[4609,["And these seven chakras, here on the left","and the right, they have to be awakened."]],[4617,["Through these, the Kundalini will be","invoked. Through these - it is","absolutely scientific."]],[4627,["And doctors also believe that these","are the endings of the sympathetic.","They do believe."]],[4633,["But they don't know its utility, what","to do further. Straight like this."]],[4640,["And it would be good to take off your","glasses, because this is also good","for the eyes."]],[4653,["Now you close the eyes and don't","open them until I tell you to."]],[4663,["Don't chant any mantras, no thoughts to","be suppressed, no need to do anything;","Kundalini does everything on its own."]],[4671,["Thus sit comfortably, relax completely,","and have complete confidence in yourself,"]],[4678,["that today only you will attain","Self-realization, today. With humility."]],[4691,["You, this is a pure desire and ask","that, \"Mother, please give us Self-","Realization,\" in your mind."]],[4699,["Today itself this is going to happen,","because your will must be manifested."]],[4706,["You should say that, \"We want that","we get Self-realization.\""]],[4717,["Don't open your eyes now."]],[4719,["Please close your eyes and don't open","them till I tell you."]],[4725,["You can remove your spectacles."]],[4735,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4741,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4745,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4747,["Increase its volume,"]],[4751,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4754,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4757,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4761,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4767,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4769,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4773,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4775,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4780,["[Shri Mataji blows into the mic]"]],[4785,["Please open your eyes slowly."]],[4791,["Now, put your left hand towards Me, like","this and bend your head and see through"]],[4800,["your fontanel area, bone area, if you are","getting a breeze, a cool maybe hot."]],[4807,["Put your left hand towards Me and","bend your head please. Bend your head","and see with your left hand"]],[4816,["whether some cool or warm breeze","is coming out of your palate."]],[4824,["Palate is, that is a soft part of the","head in childhood, which is called","the palate."]],[4831,["You look at it, whether a cool breeze is","coming from there? It could be warm too."]],[4839,["If you're feeling warm, say this","within yourself, \"Mother, I forgive","everyone altogether.\""]],[4845,["Very easy to say this. Just say,","\"Mother, I forgive everyone at once,\"","then the heat will go away."]],[4856,["Bend your head, bend your head;","and not on your head, but above","what is called suspended."]],[4864,["Stay above, slightly away from it.","Now, place your right hand towards","Me and bend your head again."]],[4872,["And now see with the left hand,","some get very close and some","very far away."]],[4880,["For some very subtle, and some very strong,","this is how the wind blows—you see this,","cool or hot breeze."]],[4889,["Bend your head and don't be doubtful","in any way."]],[4900,["Please put your left hand towards Me."]],[4904,["Again bend your head and right hand","towards Me."]],[4908,["Please see with your right hand, if","there's a cool or a hot breeze coming."]],[4913,["If it is hot, then you have to say in your","heart, \"Mother, I forgive everyone.\""]],[4929,["Don't doubt yourself and don't think","this, \"I'm a great sinner,\" and forget","all these things just now."]],[4936,["Because this Supreme Consciousness that","is, is an ocean of forgiveness."]],[4943,["You can't make any mistake that","doesn't get dissolved in it."]],[4954,["It is an ocean of mercy, an ocean of","knowledge, but greatest of all,","It is an ocean of forgiveness."]],[4964,["Now raise both hands and look","towards the sky."]],[4973,["And ask a question, \"Mother, is this the","Supreme Consciousness?\" Today you are","experiencing for the first time."]],[4983,["Please ask the question, \"Mother, is this","the Cool Breeze of the Holy Ghost?\""]],[4990,["Or, \"Mother, is this the Divine Power of","Love?\""]],[4995,["For the first time you are feeling it. Just","lift your head upwards and see for","yourself."]],[5001,["You'll feel on your hands or fingers.","Now put down your heads."]],[5008,["Again please put your hands towards","Me. Don't think."]],[5016,["You can do it; first state of nirvichar","samadhi, of thoughtless awareness."]],[5023,["Don't think, just don't think."]],[5033,["Now, whoever is feeling the cool breeze","or the hot breeze in their hands,"]],[5041,["or in the fingers, or cool or hot air","is coming from the palate"]],[5049,["All those who are feeling cool breeze","or hot breeze on their hands,"]],[5054,["on the finger-tips or through their","fontanel bone area"]],[5059,["all such people raise both your","hands above."]],[5063,["Please raise both your hands - all","such people who are feeling."]],[5067,["See, just see, just see so many saints and","sages. My loving greetings to all of you!"]],[5076,["You have become a saint, have become","a sage, the whole of Delhi - Oh my God!"]],[5082,["[Applause]"]],[5095,["Now just be in enjoyment, be in joy.","And come to the Collective."]],[5104,["We have centers everywhere here.","I want to see all the seeds that","have been sown,"]],[5111,["and the saplings that have now sprouted","from them may become large trees."]],[5117,["All the seeds which were sown, have","now become beautiful - what child?"]],[5127,["Sit down, sit down, sit down;","Nothing happened?"]],[5132,["Okay, sit down, sit down, will happen,","will happen, patience, patience."]],[5142,["What are you saying? You're cured?","What is there now, what more is needed;","Just get well, everyone."]],[5162,["Now, it's like this, some people get","cured instantly, they get cured right","during the program, I don't know what","it is."]],[5171,["And some people need to come a little.","Whatever it is, if you want to get","better, what's the harm in that?"]],[5178,["May have to come back once or twice more;","but many people are healed suddenly just","like that. There's no doubt about it."]],[5186,["Seeker: Mataji [UNCLEAR]"]],[5198,["(UNCLEAR)"]],[5204,["Sahaja Yogi: Gets some sort of a","tingling sensation in the feet and","hands, but he can come in the centre."]],[5210,["Shri Mataji: At least come to the center.","No, no, there's no problem. Please","come to the center."]],[5217,["And your liver is damaged. They will","tell you what the treatment is."]],[5221,["And that will alleviate all your troubles,","Okay.","Seeker: (UNCLEAR)"]],[5227,["Shri Mataji: But since you haven't","even made any effort, what's the","point in complaining about it?"]],[5233,["Make some effort first, and if it","doesn't work out, then it's okay.","Come and see at least."]],[5238,["Seeker: I will definitely do that."]],[5239,["Shri Mataji: How many people here","can raise their hands and say"]],[5243,["that they didn't benefit from","Sahaja Yoga, tell Me? Indians."]],[5248,["Has been very beneficial. Look, so","many people are sitting here. Then","why wouldn't it be for you?"]],[5257,["Sahaja Yogi: All brothers are being informed"]],[5260,["Shri Mataji: I'm just saying that","all those who have, who - what do","you say to benefit - hmm?"]],[5269,["Haan, have got some sort of a benefit","out of Sahaja Yoga,"]],[5273,["those who have got some benefit out","of Sahaja Yoga, you put up your hands."]],[5280,["Wow, wow! Now look. Now when so many","people have benefited, then now what,","what more this thing do you want?"]],[5291,["Sahaja Yogi: We have many centers","all over Delhi and a chart is","made for them."]],[5297,["It's a flyer, you will get it."]],[5299,["In the follow-up program, which we have","kept for this program, in Nizamuddin,"]],[5306,["you people come to the Indian Scout","Ground at 11 o'clock. Who","(UNCLEAR) hasn't felt yet"]],[5313,["we will work on you and you may","feel it there."]],[5319,["We have a main center behind the","Qutub Bhavan, where our (UNCLEAR)","address is listed."]],[5326,["You, there's a program every","Saturday, come there."]],[5329,["We run a centre for newcomers on","Wednesdays in Safdarjung Enclave,","come there."]],[5336,["If any brother has any problem,","which is a personal problem,","we all resolve it there."]],[5342,["If there's something we can't cure,"]],[5345,["then we pray to the Shri Mataji","and She helps you."]],[5349,["My only request to you is that you all","please come to the center, and I am","confident that you will all enjoy it."]],[5360,["Tomorrow at 11 am at Indian Scout Ground,","opposite Nizamuddin Police Station."]],[5368,["And on the 8th, it's at the Ashram in","Safdarjung Enclave; you can find the","address here, at 6:30 in the evening."]],[5378,["Shri Mataji: Sing a song or two,","then I'll leave. Today the ..."]],[5390,["All these foreigners are singing, see,","you can't imagine. They even sing very","well in Marathi."]],[5397,["You will not be able to recognize","who is singing."]],[5400,["Otherwise, teaching them even a","single word of Hindi would have","been a very difficult task."]],[5416,["Sit down and listen to this song, you'll","enjoy it. Sit down. Listen to a song."]],[5421,["It will feel good. Now you will","enjoy the song."]],[5447,["Just sit down, he is telling you to","come and they will tell you everything."]],[5457,["Now, please come tomorrow. What date?","They've invited you tomorrow. Come","tomorrow at 11 o'clock."]],[5462,["And after that they have centres all","over Delhi. There are many centres.","They'll tell you everything."]],[5468,["In a month you'll become a guru of","yourself and of everyone else."]],[5476,["Listen, no, no, no, no [MARATHI]","What are you doing?"]],[5485,["Not this song. This is for Maharashtra","desha."]],[5489,["We are not sitting in Maharashtra","desha, this time alright? Sing some","other song."]],[5493,["What are you doing? Tell an appropriate","song. That gentleman from Noida, that","boy, he was singing well."]],[5502,["[MARATHI]"]],[5520,["[MARATHI] Saat janam [MARATHI]"]],[5526,["This song, this song was composed","by these people, and they also","composed the tune."]],[5538,["[Bhajan - Saat janam jo punya hue hain -","From 32:11 to 39:20]"]],[5964,["[Bolo Adishakti Mataji Shri Nirmala","Devi ki jai!]"]],[5970,["Sit for a minute, sit for a minute."]],[5993,["These people want to sing one more song."]],[5996,["Sit down. Everyone is happy. This","song is sung during Guru Puja;","what should one ask from the Guru?"]],[6034,["[Bhajan - Vinati suniye Adishakti meri -","From 40:20 to  45:44]"]],[6353,["[Adishakti Mataji Shri Nirmala","Devi ki jai!]"]],[6383,["[Shri Nirmala Mata ki jai!]"]],[6390,["[Adishakti Mataji Shri Nirmala Devi","ki jai! Shri Nirmala Devi ki jai!","Shri Nirmala Devi ki jai!]"]],[6398,["[Jagat Janani Ma ki jai! Adishakti","Ma ki jai!]"]],[6406,["[Bolo Shri Adishakti Mataji Shri Nirmala","Devi ki jai!]"]]]);
